<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stocks soar 3.01 pct before close.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stocks soar 3.01 pct before close.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan share prices surged minutes before close on Wednesday on strong buying in the heavily weighted financial sector that brokers said appeared to have been led by government-related funds.</p>
<p>With five minutes left, at 0355 GMT, the index had jumped 3.01 percent to 8,191.59 points. Turnover was T$106 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
